[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0623","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0623.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0107","title":"Symantec Veritas Backup Agent 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Symantec Veritas Backup 4.5 Linux 版 Backup Agent 服务存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可在不与服务端进行任何数据交互的情况下直接建立 TCP 连接，导致 Backup Agent 进程挂起（hang），从而无法响应正常的备份请求，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞攻击条件简单，无需认证即可远程触发，影响 Veritas Backup 4.5 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0107"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:40Z","remediation":"升级到 Symantec Veritas Backup 4.5 最新补丁包或迁移至受支持的 Veritas Backup Exec 版本。如无法升级，在防火墙上限制对 Backup agent 端口（默认 10000/tcp）的访问，仅允许受信任的备份服务器 IP 连接，并配置 idle timeout 断开空连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97958921407182&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2204","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3eae031b5df6a3c6a1cc304f5e054cd002eb1bd6/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0107.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0107.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0107","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0107.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0107.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0107.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b7a3f185461ada4598db88be1e2c953e4d2cddec/2001/CVE-2001-0107.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0107.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0107.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0107.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0623.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0576","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0576.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0017","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 PPTP 服务器拒绝服务漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Windows NT 4.0 的 PPTP 服务器存在内存泄漏漏洞。攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的畸形 PPTP 数据包触发该漏洞，导致服务器内存持续泄漏，最终耗尽系统资源并引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有运行 Windows NT 4.0 系统上内建的 PPTP 服务实例，攻击者无需身份认证即可在远程发起攻击。由于攻击条件简单且无需交互，攻击者可轻易利用此漏洞使 PPTP 服务器无法为合法用户提供正常的 VPN 拨入服务，造成业务中断。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0017"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:29Z","remediation":"应用 Microsoft 安全公告 MS01-009 发布的补丁（知识库文章 Q283001），该补丁修复 PPTP 服务在处理畸形数据包时的内存泄漏问题。对于运行 Windows NT 4.0 Service Pack 6a 的系统，可从 Microsoft 下载中心获取并安装对应版本补丁，补丁安装后可通过注册表项 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\Hotfix\\Q283001 验证。若 PPTP 服务并非业务必需，建议直接禁用该服务以消除攻击面。由于 Windows NT 4.0 已终止支持，长期解决方案是升级至受支持的操作系统版本（如 Windows Server 2019/2022），并使用更安全的 VPN 替代方案（如 SSTP 或 IKEv2）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2368","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-009","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6103","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9aad85737366330ff6d3c29419443c9111c35207/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0017.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/49185e9cdc5fc147738c38ed039cc265d56e905d/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0017.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0017","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0017.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0017.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0017.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7e7ff27a2a43d6a76e9c2a314d1074b5484220ae/2001/CVE-2001-0017.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/6450d916b228b26926c778e450e50985a2beb640/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0017.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0017.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0017.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0576.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0575","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0575.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0016","title":"Microsoft Windows NT NTLMSSP 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Windows NT 系统中的 NTLM 安全支持提供程序（NTLMSSP）服务存在权限提升漏洞。该服务在处理本地过程调用（LPC）请求时未对功能号进行严格校验，导致具有本地登录权限的未经身份验证的攻击者可构造特制请求绕过安全检查，从而获取系统管理员级别访问权限。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 及后续版本中依赖 NTLMSSP 进行身份验证的系统组件，攻击者仅需具备目标主机的本地访问权限即可利用，CVSS v2 评分为 7.2，危害等级高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0016"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:29Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS01-008 对应补丁（KB280119），该补丁适用于已安装 Service Pack 6a 的 Windows NT 4.0 Workstation、Server、Enterprise Edition 及 Service Pack 6 的 Terminal Server Edition，可从 Microsoft 下载中心获取并安装。安装后验证注册表项 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\Hotfix\\Q280119 是否存在以确认补丁生效。如无法立即安装补丁，应通过组策略限制非特权用户的交互式登录权限，仅允许可信用户在终端登录，以降低本地用户利用此漏洞提权至系统管理员权限的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://razor.bindview.com/publish/advisories/adv_NTLMSSP.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2348","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-008","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6076","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b565ef51c288ce15e405affdff907e4830eb8f32/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0016.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/49185e9cdc5fc147738c38ed039cc265d56e905d/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0016.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0016","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0016.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0016.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0016.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7e7ff27a2a43d6a76e9c2a314d1074b5484220ae/2001/CVE-2001-0016.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/6450d916b228b26926c778e450e50985a2beb640/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0016.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0016.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0016.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0575.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0574","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0574.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0015","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 NetDDE 权限提升漏洞","description":"Windows 2000 系统中的 Network Dynamic Data Exchange（NetDDE）组件存在权限提升漏洞。该漏洞的原理在于 NetDDE 使用了一个不可见窗口来处理 DDE 消息，而该窗口以 WINLOGON 进程的权限运行，WINLOGON 进程拥有系统级别的 SYSTEM 权限。本地攻击者无需任何身份认证，只需向该不可见窗口发送特制的 WM_COPYDATA 消息，即可利用 DDE 消息机制将自身权限提升至 SYSTEM 级别。此漏洞影响 Windows 2000 操作系统，攻击条件为攻击者已获得目标系统的本地访问权限（例如通过交互式登录或远程桌面连接）。成功利用后，攻击者可完全控制系统，执行任意代码、修改系统配置或窃取敏感数据。Microsoft 在 2001 年 2 月发布的安全公告 MS01-007 中提供了修复补丁，建议受影响用户立即安装该安全更新以消除漏洞风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0015"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:29Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS01-007 补丁（KB285851），或升级至 Windows 2000 Service Pack 3。如无法立即打补丁，可通过运行 services.msc 禁用 Network DDE 服务作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2001/a020501-1.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2341","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-007","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6062","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b565ef51c288ce15e405affdff907e4830eb8f32/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0015.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/49185e9cdc5fc147738c38ed039cc265d56e905d/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0015.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0015","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0015.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0015.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7e7ff27a2a43d6a76e9c2a314d1074b5484220ae/2001/CVE-2001-0015.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0015.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/6450d916b228b26926c778e450e50985a2beb640/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0015.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0015.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0015.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0574.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0421","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0421.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0925","title":"Apache HTTP Server 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Apache 1.3.19 之前版本的默认安装中存在路径遍历漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送包含大量连续斜杠（/）字符的特制 HTTP 请求，导致服务器在处理请求路径时错误地绕过 multiview 机制，直接列出目录文件列表而非返回 index.html 索引页面。该漏洞影响 mod_negotiation、mod_dir 和 mod_autoindex 三个模块，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，导致敏感目录结构及文件信息泄露。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0925"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:14Z","remediation":"升级 Apache 至 1.3.19 或更高版本。Debian 用户可参考 DSA-067 安全公告安装更新，Mandrake 用户可参考 MDKSA-2001-077 获取补丁。如无法立即升级，在 httpd.conf 中移除 Options 指令中的 Indexes 参数，并确保 DirectoryIndex index.html 配置正确，同时禁用 mod_autoindex 模块以缓解目录列表泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.apacheweek.com/features/security-13","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-067","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-077.php3","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-1452.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/168497","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/178066","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/193081","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2503","http://www.securityfocus.com/cgi-bin/archive.pl?id=1&start=2002-01-27&end=2002-02-02&mid=199857&threads=1","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6921","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r5419c9ba0951ef73a655362403d12bb8d10fab38274deb3f005816f5%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r9f93cf6dde308d42a9c807784e8102600d0397f5f834890708bf6920%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rf2f0f3611f937cf6cfb3b4fe4a67f69885855126110e1e3f2fb2728e%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rf6449464fd8b7437704c55f88361b66f12d5b5f90bcce66af4be4ba9%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20695","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2001/CVE-2001-0925.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0925.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0925","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/httpd-vulnerabilities/blob/b71e143e670cd0a24ad5402f3d46c0ba20429842/cves/CVE-2001-0925.yml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0298403c910e42219c357a4f56dac428565b2e47/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0925.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qr8r-5469-gp63/GHSA-qr8r-5469-gp63.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/11a92cc3c0d31b9e78fe8f2a857dd04df3195701/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0925.md","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2001/0xxx/cve-2001-0925.yaml","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-067.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0421.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0378","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0378.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1229","title":"Xiph.org Icecast libshout 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Icecast 1.3.9 之前版本及 libshout 1.0.4 之前版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程未认证攻击者可通过发送特制的恶意数据流触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务拒绝（进程崩溃）乃至远程任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Icecast 流媒体服务器及 libshout 客户端库的早期版本，CVSS 评分 7.5（高危），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证、可导致机密性/完整性/可用性均受影响。攻击者可通过向 Icecast 服务器发送畸形流媒体数据或诱导客户端连接恶意服务器触发漏洞，最终在目标系统上以服务进程权限执行任意代码。官方已在 Icecast 1.3.9 和 libshout 1.0.4 中修复该漏洞，建议升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1229"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:51Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Icecast 到 1.3.9 或更高版本，并将 libshout 升级到 1.0.4 或更高版本。可从官方站点 icecast.org 下载最新版本并替换原有二进制文件。若暂时无法升级，可在防火墙层面限制 Icecast 服务端口（默认 8000）仅允许受信任 IP 访问，或暂时停用 Icecast 服务作为临时缓解措施。建议同时升级依赖 libshout 的客户端应用至 1.0.4 以上版本。升级后重启服务并验证版本号确认修复生效。务必从官方源下载以防供应链投毒。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000387","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98438880622976&w=2","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-063.html","http://www.xiph.org/archives/icecast/0074.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2a4c15d247e2aa1e32bb9712f81631be3a25fb82/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1229.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1229","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1229.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eba749de89f8c70fe7dc7fa1f83de98dd5147c06/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1229.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jv77-c9mf-jr67/GHSA-jv77-c9mf-jr67.json","https://github.com/freebsd/freebsd-ports/blob/58376fbc0dd642d78dda39e7bbfa81a124730b7d/security/vuxml/vuln/2004.xml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-1229.md","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/icecast_libshout_bof.nasl","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/freebsd_pkg_5e92e8a25d7b11d880e30020ed76ef5a.nasl","https://github.com/illuusio/freebsd-osv/blob/3234f9e67d0170ff9c6cada9a1f48f061b109728/md/2004/FreeBSD-2004-0016.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0378.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0234","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0234.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0141","title":"mgetty 符号链接攻击导致任意文件写入漏洞","description":"mgetty 1.1.22 在特定配置下存在符号链接攻击漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在目标系统上创建恶意的符号链接，诱使 mgetty 进程以当前用户权限覆写任意系统文件，导致文件完整性被破坏或权限提升。该漏洞攻击复杂度较高，需要本地访问权限且依赖特定配置环境，CVSS 评分仅 1.2，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0141"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:44Z","remediation":"升级 mgetty 至 1.1.23 或更高版本。Debian 用户执行 `apt-get update && apt-get upgrade mgetty`；Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2001:050 提供的更新包；Caldera 用户安装 CSSA-2001-002.0 补丁。如无法升级，确保 mgetty 临时目录（如 /var/spool/mgetty）仅 root 可写，并避免在多用户环境下使用 mgetty 的自动传真接收功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97916374410647&w=2","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-002.0.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-011","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-009.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-050.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2187","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5918","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8f86f3866df0d1c5d8aff409ea4847883047cbe6/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0141.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0141.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0141","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0141.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0141.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2f1dc3c74795bf8c2a96508a614db2a7dd079182/2001/CVE-2001-0141.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8eabcabeccc08fd880f454fd53f7419ecf9a8d7e/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0141.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0141.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0141.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2001-0141.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0234.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0232","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0232.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0131","title":"Apache HTTP Server 本地用户任意文件覆盖漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 附带的 htpasswd 和 htdigest 工具存在符号链接攻击漏洞（CWE-59），本地未授权攻击者可通过创建指向敏感系统文件的符号链接，诱使 htpasswd 或 htdigest 在写入密码文件时跟随该链接，从而覆盖目标系统上的任意文件，造成文件完整性破坏。该漏洞影响 Apache 2.0a9、1.3.14 等多个版本，波及 Debian Linux 2.2、Red Hat Linux 7.0 等操作系统。攻击者需要具备目标主机的本地访问权限，攻击复杂度为中等。成功利用后可篡改关键系统文件，进而可能获得提升的权限或导致服务中断。Debian 已在安全公告 DSA-021 中发布对应修复补丁。","severity":"LOW","score":3.3,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0131"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:43Z","remediation":"立即升级 Apache HTTP Server 至 1.3.42（1.3.x 系列最终版）或 2.4.x 最新稳定版；若短期内无法升级，请将受影响版本的 htpasswd 与 htdigest 程序所在目录（通常为 /usr/bin/ 或安装目录）的权限设置为仅 root 可写（chmod 755），并移除目录的组写与其他写权限，防止本地用户创建符号链接覆盖敏感文件。同时检查 /etc/passwd、/etc/shadow 及 Web 根目录下是否存在被恶意创建或修改的文件，必要时从已知良好备份恢复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97916374410647&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-021","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2182","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5926","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cbc8909f965784fa84e604f999ad78ba1a862d6c/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0131.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0131.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0131","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0131.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0131.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9854c179c024bf1d349f724d8589444858e69aa7/2001/CVE-2001-0131.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8e09cd003036511dff025515f28920f1d343007b/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0131.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0131.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/c6e457224984003aac7610b750677033fb679879/tracker/CVE/2001/CVE-2001-0131.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0131.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0232.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0230","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0230.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0128","title":"Zope Zope 安全绕过漏洞","description":"Zope 2.2.4 之前版本在计算本地角色时存在安全缺陷，由于角色权限计算逻辑不完善，已认证用户可通过构造特殊请求绕过预设的访问控制限制，获取本不应拥有的管理权限。成功利用该漏洞可导致攻击者完全控制受影响系统，实现任意操作。该漏洞影响 Zope 2.2.4 以下所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0128"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:42Z","remediation":"升级 Zope 至 2.2.4 或更高版本，该版本修复了本地角色计算不当导致的权限绕过问题。如无法立即升级，应严格限制用户对 Zope 管理界面的访问权限，并审查所有用户角色分配，确保最小权限原则。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000365","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001219","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/updates/2000/MDKSA-2000-083.php3","http://www.osvdb.org/6284","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-127.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5777","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86965a1ef7a64a35a4bffc5193446981deb1b2f5/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0128.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0128","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0128.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0128.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6c23d699ab95dd8042ecb6df739cafdf209913a6/2001/CVE-2001-0128.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8e09cd003036511dff025515f28920f1d343007b/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0128.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0128.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0128.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0128.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2001-0128.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0230.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0228","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0228.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0117","title":"GNU diffutils sdiff 本地文件覆盖漏洞","description":"diffutils 包中的 sdiff 2.7 版本存在符号链接攻击漏洞。本地攻击者可通过创建恶意符号链接，利用 sdiff 在处理临时文件时未正确检查文件类型的缺陷，诱使 sdiff 以提升的权限错误地覆盖目标文件，导致系统文件被非授权篡改或破坏。攻击条件为攻击者拥有本地用户权限并能创建符号链接，属于典型的 TOCTOU 竞态条件利用。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0117"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:41Z","remediation":"建议升级 diffutils 至 2.7 以上版本，或安装对应发行版的安全补丁：Red Hat Linux 用户安装 RHSA-2001-116 提供的更新包；Mandrake Linux 用户安装 MDKSA-2001-008 更新；Immunix 用户安装 IMNX-2000-70-028-01 更新。如无法升级，避免在不可信目录下以 root 权限运行 sdiff，并使用 umask 限制临时文件权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://download.immunix.org/ImmunixOS/7.0/updates/IMNX-2000-70-028-01","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97916374410647&w=2","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/579928","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-008.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-116.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2191","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5914","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7db8931ea0378982e66f435e269a4ed0e4efb7aa/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0117.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0117","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0117.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0117.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/8ed64b4e31209e933908eff50d33cf701402ff24/2001/CVE-2001-0117.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0117.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0117.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0117.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0117.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2001-0117.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0228.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0226","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0226.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0108","title":"PHP Apache 模块 .htaccess 访问限制绕过漏洞","description":"PHP Apache 模块 4.0.4 及更早版本存在安全绕过漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证即可向未受 .htaccess 限制的页面发送特制的畸形 HTTP 请求，导致 PHP 错误地将访问控制规则应用于后续请求的页面，从而绕过 .htaccess 的访问限制，获取受限资源的读取权限。该漏洞影响运行 mod_php 的 Apache Web 服务器，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0108"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:40Z","remediation":"建议升级 PHP Apache 模块至 4.0.5 或更高版本。Red Hat 用户应安装 RHSA-2000-136 提供的更新包；Debian 用户应用 DSA-020 安全更新；Mandrake 用户安装 MDKSA-2001-013 补丁。如无法升级，可在 Apache 配置中禁用 PHP 的 .htaccess 覆盖功能（AllowOverride None）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000373","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97957961212852","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-020","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-013.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-136.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2206","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5940","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3eae031b5df6a3c6a1cc304f5e054cd002eb1bd6/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0108.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0108","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0108.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0108.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b7a3f185461ada4598db88be1e2c953e4d2cddec/2001/CVE-2001-0108.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0108.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0108.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0108.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0108.json","https://github.com/psecio/versionscan/blob/81cee8accd05924b8421db9ed2a867047819d15a/CONTRIBUTING.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0226.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0226.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0055","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0055.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0144","title":"SSH1 CRC-32 补偿攻击检测器整数溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"SSH1 协议实现中的 CRC-32 补偿攻击检测器存在整数溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标 SSH 服务器或客户端发送特制数据包，触发整数溢出绕过 CRC-32 校验检测机制，进而实现远程任意命令执行。该漏洞影响 SSH 1.2.x 及早期版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击者只需网络可达即可利用，无需任何权限，完全控制目标系统。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0144"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:45Z","remediation":"立即停止使用 SSH 协议第一版 (SSH-1)，升级至 OpenSSH 3.0 及以上版本（默认使用 SSH-2 协议，不受此漏洞影响）。如无法升级，在 sshd_config 中设置 Protocol 2 禁用 SSH-1 协议。Cisco CSS 11000 系列用户需升级至 WebNS 4.01 B42s、4.10 22s、5.0 B11s 或 5.01 B6s 及以上版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98168366406903&w=2","http://razor.bindview.com/publish/advisories/adv_ssh1crc.html","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-35.html","http://www.osvdb.org/503","http://www.osvdb.org/795","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2347","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6083","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20617","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2001/CVE-2001-0144.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2007/CVE-2007-4654.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa