cus.com/bid/2203","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-010","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5937","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20553","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/90ce235668535187d033418a98446c7a08506c82/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0137.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0137.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0137","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0137.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0137.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/d6ca921ab16ef1f62d93ae6c66f1b85dd0b881a9/2001/CVE-2001-0137.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0137.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/fb4a6b1b054a1fd4a892f5260545dddbd2342f5a/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0137.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0137.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2001-0137.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0054.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0054.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0054.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0053","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0053.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0136","title":"ProFTPD 1.2.0rc2 内存泄漏拒绝服务漏洞","description":"ProFTPD 1.2.0rc2 版本存在内存泄漏漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过发送大量 USER 命令消耗服务器内存资源，导致服务响应缓慢甚至崩溃，造成拒绝服务。若服务器安装配置不当，攻击者还可利用 SIZE 命令触发同样的内存泄漏问题。该漏洞影响 ProFTPD 1.2.0rc2 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。建议升级至 1.2.0rc3 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0136"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:44Z","remediation":"升级 ProFTPD 至 1.2.1 或更高版本，该漏洞已在 1.2.0 正式版及后续版本中修复。如无法立即升级，可在配置文件中限制单个 IP 的连接速率和最大 USER 命令次数，或通过防火墙限制对 FTP 端口的访问以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0122.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0132.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0267.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000380","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-029","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-021.php3","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/152206","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5801","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/241","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2001/CVE-2001-0136.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0136.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/152c4988e6630edbe300b2d9554f35d9c7963812/data/2001/CVE-2001-0136.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0136","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0136.json","https://github.com/OWASP/Nettacker/blob/9fa9645b65f00e77232e97bd139abd2895569e6a/docs/Modules.md","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/4709d2cbd3a3d8c1f80eac233d785d5a127e7498/CVEs/2001/CVE-2001-0136.md","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/7c77ebcc357386c71db522f18fa574b7642f74e0/data/anchore/2001/CVE-2001-0136.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0136.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0136.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0053.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0052","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0052.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0129","title":"Tinyproxy HTTP代理缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Tinyproxy HTTP 代理服务器 1.3.3 及更早版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。由于程序在处理超长的 CONNECT 请求时未对输入长度进行充分校验，导致数据写入缓冲区造成堆溢出。未经身份认证的远程攻击者只需向目标代理服务器发送特制的超长 CONNECT 请求，即可触发该漏洞，造成服务崩溃引发拒绝服务，在特定条件下甚至可能以代理进程权限执行任意命令，实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Tinyproxy 1.3.3 及之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分为 10.0，危害等级严重，建议用户尽快升级到已修复的版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0129"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:42Z","remediation":"立即升级 Tinyproxy 至 1.3.4 或更高版本。Debian 用户应执行 apt-get update && apt-get upgrade tinyproxy 安装 DSA-018 安全更新。如无法升级，可在代理配置中限制 CONNECT 请求方法长度，或在防火墙层面限制仅允许可信源访问代理端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97975486527750&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-018","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2217","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5954","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20559","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86965a1ef7a64a35a4bffc5193446981deb1b2f5/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0129.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0129.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0129","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0129.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0129.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6c23